40 Acres is a action, thriller, drama film directed by R.T. Thorne.

3
00:19:56,470 --> 00:20:02,470
Hailey Freeman and her family are the last descendants of African American
farmers who settled in rural Canada after the Civil War.

4
00:26:35,294 --> 00:26:41,294
In a famine-decimated near future, they now struggle to safeguard their farm, as they make
one last stand against a vicious militia hell-bent on taking their 40 Acres.

