40 Acres is a 2024 Canadian post-apocalyptic
thriller film written and directed by R.

12
01:19:45,882 --> 01:19:51,882
The film stars Danielle Deadwyler as a matriarch of descendants of African-American
farmers who settled in 1875 in rural Canada after the first Civil War.

13
01:26:24,705 --> 01:26:30,705
Two hundred years later, they are trying to survive in a decimated future.

14
01:33:03,529 --> 01:33:09,529
The film premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 6, 2024, and
was theatrically released in Canada on July 4, 2025 by Mongrel Media.

15
01:39:42,352 --> 01:39:48,352
It received generally positive reviews from critics, receiving nomintations at the Black Reel Awards, NAACP Image
Awards and winning three Directors Guild of Canada Awards, including the Impact Award for Thorne.

16
01:46:21,176 --> 01:46:27,176
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking and intense.
